Package: com.adarsh.wingmankb
Name: Wingman Keyboard
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: One-tap Wingman keyboard. Shows the replies Wingman Plus just generated as buttons - tap one to type it straight into the dating app, no copy-and-paste. Switch to it with the globe key inside any chat. Needs "Allow Full Access" so it can read the replies Wingman wrote.
Maintainer: Adarsh
Author: Adarsh
Section: Keyboards
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
